{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T12:58:51Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T12:58:51Z","body":"> 似乎 PCK 没有完全保存，指向`project.godot`PCK 末尾的目录条目的大小为零。\n\nYou are right. The pck file size of the previous version that could run was 4.34G, but the current pck file size is only 2.52G.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830363647/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830399541","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105742#issuecomment-2830399541","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105742","id":2830399541,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6otHg1","user":{"login":"saibofeng","id":209067086,"node_id":"U_kgDODHYcTg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209067086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng","html_url":"https://github.com/saibofeng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T13:13:33Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T13:13:33Z","body":"Now every time I export, the PCK file size is 2.52G. I don’t know what to do?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830399541/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830466315","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105742#issuecomment-2830466315","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105742","id":2830466315,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6otX0L","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T13:39:25Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T13:39:25Z","body":"Did you check that you still have enough disk space on your `E:\\` drive?\nAnd it might also require at least 4.5G on the `C:\\` drive too where your user data is likely located, as the PCK gets written to a temporary file there before being copied I believe.\n\nIf you have enough disk space on both partitions, it might be a sign that your disk may be damaged.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830466315/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830526836","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105742#issuecomment-2830526836","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105742","id":2830526836,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6otml0","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T14:02:39Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T14:02:39Z","body":"Exporter is writing to the temp file first (which is usually on `C:`) and then copy it to the final PCK.\n\nIt looks like at some point during export writes start to fail, but it's still writing something, so it's pretty strange:\n\nColumns are `File Size`, `File offset in the PCK`, `Delta between size and what was written to PCK`:\n\nIt is writing normally at first (and adding some padding). But at some point padding writes stop (despite the size is not aligned to 16):\n\n<img width=\"1212\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/203f5854-d5c8-4685-b0e0-5e6550459a3d\" />\n\nAnd a bit later, file data writes start to fail as well:\n\n<img width=\"1212\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bfed7fb4-6b40-4a9c-a236-ed1bc5767136\" />\n\n`project.godot` is the only file with size `0`, and it is unique, since it's also saved first to the temp directory. So lack of space (or other problem) on driver `C:` seems like a feasible explanation for both.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830526836/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830532036","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105742#issuecomment-2830532036","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105742","id":2830532036,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6otn3E","user":{"login":"saibofeng","id":209067086,"node_id":"U_kgDODHYcTg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209067086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng","html_url":"https://github.com/saibofeng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T14:04:41Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T14:04:41Z","body":"> Did you check that you still have enough disk space on your `E:\\` drive? And it might also require at least 4.5G on the `C:\\` drive too where your user data is likely located, as the PCK gets written to a temporary file there before being copied I believe.\n> \n> If you have enough disk space on both partitions, it might be a sign that your disk may be damaged.\n\nThank you very much. The reason is that the C drive is not enough. My C drive has only 2.52G left, so the PCK file is also 2.52G. When I expanded the C drive, the problem disappeared. Thank you very much.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830532036/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830540684","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105742#issuecomment-2830540684","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105742","id":2830540684,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6otp-M","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T14:08:05Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T14:09:28Z","body":"See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/45354.\n\nWe should probably warn when exporting a project with less than 10 GB of space left on the current drive and the target drive. Movie Maker mode does something similar already: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/62418\n\nSeveral other operations in the editor should have similar warnings/errors in place too, such as installing export templates. Even opening the editor itself requires a small amount of free space to work correctly (around 1 GB to be safe).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830540684/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830540709","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105742#issuecomment-2830540709","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105742","id":2830540709,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6otp-l","user":{"login":"saibofeng","id":209067086,"node_id":"U_kgDODHYcTg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209067086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng","html_url":"https://github.com/saibofeng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saibofeng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T14:08:05Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T14:08:05Z","body":"bruvzg.  Thank you very much, it was caused by insufficient space on the C drive.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830540709/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830543228","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105742#issuecomment-2830543228","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105742","id":2830543228,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6otql8","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T14:09:09Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T14:09:09Z","body":"We should at least add a check to make sure all data was written and fail export if it's not.\n\nGetting rid of temp file also would make sense (will require PCK format change, but it's not binary compatible between versions in any case).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830543228/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955041711","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105742#issuecomment-2955041711","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105742","id":2955041711,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wIluv","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user